<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading" class="py-32 md:py-48">
  <h2 id="about-heading" class="reveal font-display font-semibold text-[clamp(3.5rem,11.5vw,179.194px)] tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[0.88] text-text-primary p-2">
    Introduction
  </h2>
  <div class="mt-20 md:mt-28 flex flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-6 items-start">
    <div class="md:col-start-3 md:col-span-1 mb-4 md:mb-0 p-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-text-muted pt-1 block">About</span>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-start-4 md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4 space-y-10 p-2">
      <p class="reveal font-display text-[23.04px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1e1e1f] p-2" style="animation-delay: calc(var(--stagger) * 1)">
        I'm Arnav — a developer focused on static-first, token-disciplined interfaces. I ship accessible Astro sites with zero-JS defaults, live GitHub stats as a narrow client exception, and Vercel deploys that stay fast on the edge.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal font-display text-[23.04px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1e1e1f] p-2" style="animation-delay: calc(var(--stagger) * 2)">
        Current focus: FastAPI + Astro + Expo monorepos (Mira Coach — resume builder & AI coach), fleet tracking dashboards, and design systems that enforce motion and layout tokens instead of hard-coded values.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
